'''Pine''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 4th tier in the Main Event during the [[Christmas Event 2019|2019 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Imprinted on the blade is a green pine leaf texture, hence the name. The guard and handle use a dark brown wood texture, resembling a pine tree.

==Trivia==
*It has a [[Pine (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name.

